00:16:08,240 --> 00:16:09,400
What?

266
00:16:09,680 --> 00:16:10,720
Nothing happened.

267
00:16:11,280 --> 00:16:13,380
Oh, something has happened.

268
00:16:14,520 --> 00:16:18,600
Behold, the supreme Dragon Master Knight.

269
00:16:19,260 --> 00:16:21,960
Now see his awesome powers.

270
00:16:27,020 --> 00:16:28,300
What's going on?

271
00:16:30,800 --> 00:16:33,212
Those dragons were sent to the graveyard.

272
00:16:33,420 --> 00:16:34,617
How could they be back?

273
00:16:34,700 --> 00:16:37,935
Look, something's even
happening to our picking dragon.

274
00:16:40,300 --> 00:16:43,117
The Dragon Master Knight gains the attack

275
00:16:43,200 --> 00:16:45,797
power of every dragon
ever played on the field,

276
00:16:45,880 --> 00:16:48,409
including ones that
were already destroyed.

277
00:16:49,120 --> 00:16:51,040
Now, in the memory of Joey,

278
00:16:51,600 --> 00:16:55,540
My, Mokuba, we will topple your beast!

279
00:16:58,320 --> 00:17:01,040
Attack, Dragon Master Knight!

280
00:17:02,040 --> 00:17:04,020
Dragon Saber Blast!

281
00:17:28,520 --> 00:17:29,350
What's this?

282
00:17:31,960 --> 00:17:32,980
Where are we?

283
00:17:33,480 --> 00:17:35,097
Our heroes! You did it!

284
00:17:35,180 --> 00:17:36,474
You slayed the dragon!

285
00:17:37,400 --> 00:17:38,520
Our heroes!

286
00:17:38,820 --> 00:17:42,761
What you've done will keep my people
and our land safe forevermore!

287
00:17:43,060 --> 00:17:45,477
We're not the ones that
you should be cheering.

288
00:17:45,560 --> 00:17:47,677
There shouldn't even be any cheering.

289
00:17:47,760 --> 00:17:49,437
I lost my brother in there.

290
00:17:49,520 --> 00:17:50,600
Fear not.

291
00:17:50,840 --> 00:17:52,917
The losses you've
suffered are too great for

292
00:17:53,000 --> 00:17:55,765
any hero to bear no matter
how strong they are.

293
00:18:01,700 --> 00:18:02,530
Remarkable.

294
00:18:02,680 --> 00:18:05,300
The princess is actually the mystical elf.

295
00:18:05,460 --> 00:18:08,284
She's casting a spell to
bring back our friends.

296
00:18:16,000 --> 00:18:17,120
Oh, they're back!

297
00:18:17,440 --> 00:18:20,840
Mokuba, oh man, what just happened to us?

298
00:18:21,280 --> 00:18:22,480
Big brother!

299
00:18:29,360 --> 00:18:30,540
The exit portal.

300
00:18:30,760 --> 00:18:31,760
Let's go, Mokuba.

301
00:18:32,240 --> 00:18:33,780
Hey, hold it a sec, Kaiba.

302
00:18:34,360 --> 00:18:37,097
Don't you think the very least you
could do is say thank you or something?

303
00:18:37,180 --> 00:18:41,800
I never asked for your help, and as far
as I'm concerned, I never needed it.

304
00:18:42,220 --> 00:18:43,050
Ah, come on!

305
00:18:43,600 --> 00:18:47,060
Yugi, you on the other hand,
I will offer some gratitude.

306
00:18:48,040 --> 00:18:48,870
Huh?

307
00:18:48,953 --> 00:18:50,620
We made a good team, you and I.

308
00:18:50,860 --> 00:18:54,397
But don't think it means we'll
be partnering up in true reality.

309
00:18:54,480 --> 00:18:59,197
Very well, but despite whatever grudge you
may still hold against me and the others,

310
00:18:59,280 --> 00:19:01,317
perhaps you can at least
begin to stop looking

311
00:19:01,400 --> 00:19:04,520
at us as just adversaries
and more as friends.

312
00:19:05,880 --> 00:19:07,120
Come on, Noguba.

313
00:19:07,520 --> 00:19:08,380
I'm coming!

314
00:19:09,300 --> 00:19:11,200
He's a pretty cheery guy, huh?

315
00:19:11,480 --> 00:19:12,940
Thank you, our heroes.

316
00:19:13,340 --> 00:19:15,957
Your brave deeds will
always be remembered here.

317
00:19:16,040 --> 00:19:19,160
And we will always remember
all of you. See ya!

318
00:19:23,040 --> 00:19:24,960
We're in! Oh, no!

319
00:19:25,320 --> 00:19:26,280
Bring it on!

320
00:19:27,960 --> 00:19:28,790
What?

321
00:19:30,100 --> 00:19:31,200
Hey, Joey!

322
00:19:33,960 --> 00:19:36,300
Yugi, Joey, you're all back.

323
00:19:36,460 --> 00:19:37,401
And so is Kaiba.

324
00:19:37,640 --> 00:19:40,017
He's probably getting
out of his pod right now.

325
00:19:40,100 --> 00:19:41,260
No, he can't be.

326
00:19:41,460 --> 00:19:45,977
And without you guys to guard your bosses,
I'd say he's about to kick some butt.

327
00:19:46,060 --> 00:19:47,400
Hey, he's right.

328
00:19:47,580 --> 00:19:49,660
We gotta get back. We did it.

329
00:19:49,800 --> 00:19:50,940
Bunch of wimps.

330
00:19:53,640 --> 00:19:54,470
It's mine.

331
00:19:54,553 --> 00:19:55,833
She was here all along.

332
00:19:56,760 --> 00:19:58,657
In the flesh, is everything cool?

333
00:19:58,740 --> 00:19:59,697
Sure looks that way.

334
00:19:59,780 --> 00:20:01,000
Because of you.

335
00:20:01,300 --> 00:20:02,140
All of you.

336
00:20:02,460 --> 00:20:04,360
So thanks. Oh, stop.

337
00:20:04,700 --> 00:20:06,677
Now go on and get out of here already.

338
00:20:06,760 --> 00:20:09,348
Your brother probably
can't wait to see you.

339
00:20:09,460 --> 00:20:11,560
Okay, thanks again, you guys. Bye!

340
00:20:11,800 --> 00:20:12,740
Bye, Mokuma!

341
00:20:13,220 --> 00:20:14,100
Yeah, bye.

342
00:20:14,420 --> 00:20:15,577
Now, where's the John?

343
00:20:15,660 --> 00:20:18,778
I had, like, seven sodas
before we got in those pods.

344
00:20:24,520 --> 00:20:25,350
John!
